        ecrm:P3_has_note    "There are pieces in similar style in two German museums :\nKunst und Gewerbemuseum, Hamburg, inv.1892.201, dated 1627 and with monogram BB; \nStickmustermuseum Celle, dated 1620 and signed Keneke Bobers.\nAnother piece formerly in the Focke Museum fur bremische Altertumer, Bremen, inv.K1230a, dated 1620 and signed Keneke Hollen, is now lost."@en ;
